# Only an enchantment controlled by the ability's controller can be sacrificed (CR 701.21a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald x2
Enigmatic Incarnation
Fang of Shigeki
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Fang of Shigeki
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enigmatic Incarnation.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fang of Shigeki.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fang of Shigeki.Cast
[T3 Bot1.End]
! Bot1.Choose(Bot2.Battlefield.Fang of Shigeki)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Fang of Shigeki)
Bot1.Search()
